WEBVTT

00:01:29.400 --> 00:01:29.700
Dad?

00:01:30.060 --> 00:01:36.320
Two French ghost hunters are investigating a haunted mansion in Venice and they want you to help verify the findings?

00:01:36.960 --> 00:01:42.000
Well, it does so happen to be the most paranormally active house in all of Europe, if not the world.

00:01:42.680 --> 00:01:43.740
I don't like it, Doc.

00:01:44.040 --> 00:01:47.640
How do we know these French scientists aren't just using you to push their own careers?

00:01:48.330 --> 00:01:49.730
The race has a point, Dr. Quest.

00:01:50.050 --> 00:01:50.430
Yes.

00:01:51.020 --> 00:01:54.320
But to tell the truth, I have always wanted to investigate this house myself.

00:01:54.710 --> 00:01:57.370
I've studied and read about the history of this place for years.

00:01:58.820 --> 00:01:59.960
Well, if you want to know...

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:04.020
I want my opinion. If it's not haunted now, it sure looks like it oughta be.

00:02:17.390 --> 00:02:22.280
Beware the house. It is cursed. It holds a deep hunger.

00:02:23.240 --> 00:02:26.360
You have been forewarned. Beware.

00:02:27.420 --> 00:02:29.770
Uh, yeah, thanks.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:37.760
good everything Johnny? yeah Hodge well he seems happy to leave this place yeah

00:02:37.760 --> 00:02:44.670
and he warned us to do the same I don't know Hodge what is it my friend?

00:02:48.340 --> 00:02:51.160
beginning to get a pretty bad feeling about this place

00:03:00.030 --> 00:03:01.190
Dr. Quest!

00:03:01.470 --> 00:03:03.510
Oh, thank you so much for coming.

00:03:03.850 --> 00:03:05.170
Everything is in readiness.

00:03:05.570 --> 00:03:09.690
Our invention is hardwired into the walls of the house.

00:03:10.230 --> 00:03:11.210
I see.

00:03:11.650 --> 00:03:17.230
As part of my verification, I'll need you to explain to me the exact function of your invention.

00:03:17.550 --> 00:03:19.350
But of course...

00:03:19.600 --> 00:03:23.580
The electromagnetic field created by paranormal activity...

00:03:23.580 --> 00:03:26.840
...flows into our device and is transformed into that.

00:03:27.080 --> 00:03:29.960
Then the electromagnetic field is disposed...

00:03:30.540 --> 00:03:31.440
I love the vice.

00:03:31.660 --> 00:03:35.300
Oui, oui, which emits a counter-electric pulse.

00:03:35.500 --> 00:03:38.480
In effect, destroying any ghostly entities.

00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:39.800
Wow.

00:03:42.100 --> 00:03:42.660
Fascinating.

00:03:43.210 --> 00:03:45.490
Do you gentlemen mind if I look over your invention?

00:03:45.870 --> 00:03:48.190
Oh, we would be most honored.

00:03:49.980 --> 00:03:53.920
Greg, once we have the endorsement of the famous Dr. Quest.

00:03:54.300 --> 00:03:55.680
Oui, oui, François.

00:03:55.900 --> 00:03:59.020
We will finally be respected in the scientific community.

00:03:59.320 --> 00:03:59.960
Move again.

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:03.180
With respect, we will be able to sell our invention for many millions.

00:04:03.400 --> 00:04:04.300
We will be rich!

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:29.650
Strange. I feel that this wall, it hides something.

00:04:30.320 --> 00:04:32.480
Reveals it. Something evil.

00:04:33.820 --> 00:04:35.580
You're talking in riddles, Hodge.

00:04:36.120 --> 00:04:38.260
Johnny, Hodge, we're about to start.

00:04:38.720 --> 00:04:45.420
Come on. Sounds like Dad and those two French guys are about to exorcise the house of that evil vibe you feel.

00:04:45.960 --> 00:04:50.260
I do not know, Johnny. I am beginning to share your very bad feeling about this.

00:04:50.720 --> 00:04:52.120
What's wrong?

00:05:07.840 --> 00:05:15.750
than zero. Can you be more specific? Oui, oui, much more than zero. You sure these guys know what

00:05:15.750 --> 00:05:20.710
they're doing? Well, the equipment is scientifically sound, but Francois and Eric don't seem to know

00:05:20.710 --> 00:05:21.410
how to use it.

00:05:37.290 --> 00:05:39.450
You shall pay with your lives.

00:07:00.930 --> 00:07:26.150
Just a little shaken up.

00:07:28.270 --> 00:07:29.470
I'm afraid we're in a lot better shape.

00:07:30.060 --> 00:07:31.200
these poor scientists.

00:07:31.800 --> 00:07:37.060
Dad, what about Haji? You don't think that... Don't lose hope, Johnny.

00:07:37.720 --> 00:07:40.920
Perhaps we can use the data this invention collected to find out exactly

00:07:40.920 --> 00:07:41.760
what's going on.

00:07:41.960 --> 00:07:45.980
It seems that the entity or paranormal force that exists here...

00:07:45.980 --> 00:07:49.860
You mean that voice? Exactly. From the data,

00:07:50.080 --> 00:07:53.560
it appears that the entity used the power of the machine to make itself stronger,

00:07:54.020 --> 00:07:57.880
thus allowing it to physically transport Haji to the supernatural dimension.

00:07:58.350 --> 00:07:59.980
But why? That's why.

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:01.100
But we need to find out.

00:08:01.320 --> 00:08:01.760
Johnny!

00:08:02.200 --> 00:08:03.390
Dr. Quest!

00:08:05.980 --> 00:08:06.440
Haji?

00:08:07.100 --> 00:08:07.580
Haji!

00:08:09.950 --> 00:08:10.650
Help me!

00:08:28.620 --> 00:08:29.850
Son, race!

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:31.940
We may need some outside help on this

00:08:32.310 --> 00:08:32.910
Sorry, Doc.

00:08:33.480 --> 00:08:35.400
I've already tried every means of communication.

00:08:36.040 --> 00:08:37.320
They're out. Nothing but static.

00:08:38.090 --> 00:08:39.270
I guess we're on our own.

00:08:41.100 --> 00:08:47.840
Running this data through my laptop's configuration shows that an energy portal was created directly into the paranormal source.

00:08:48.230 --> 00:08:49.730
You mean the house ate Haji?

00:08:50.310 --> 00:08:52.550
Not the house, but the entity that lives here.

00:08:53.030 --> 00:08:56.090
It has the power to transport living matter to the dead zone.

00:08:57.220 --> 00:08:58.120
So do we, Dad!

00:08:58.700 --> 00:08:59.760
Only we call it...

00:09:00.060 --> 00:09:00.660
Quest World!

00:09:03.700 --> 00:09:06.700
Using the French equipment, which is already hardwired into the house,

00:09:06.940 --> 00:09:11.180
We should be able to access the house's paranormal source directly through Quest World.

00:09:11.360 --> 00:09:12.540
And save Haji.

00:09:13.080 --> 00:09:13.460
There!

00:09:13.960 --> 00:09:15.000
Everything is connected.

00:09:15.240 --> 00:09:16.040
Ready, race?

00:09:16.950 --> 00:09:18.270
Quest World logon.

00:09:18.730 --> 00:09:20.870
Subjects Johnny Quest and Race Bannon.

00:09:21.110 --> 00:09:21.870
Going high.

00:09:30.380 --> 00:09:34.100
Calibrated to Quest World sensors to pick up any signs of spiritual activity.

00:09:34.440 --> 00:09:35.620
Activate sensor scan.

00:09:36.710 --> 00:09:36.950
Yeah.

00:09:46.440 --> 00:09:46.780
Nothing.

00:09:48.740 --> 00:09:49.100
Our time.

00:09:49.260 --> 00:09:51.640
into the spirit level, but I'm reading no activity.

00:10:03.610 --> 00:10:04.530
Laser Gatling gun.

00:10:05.820 --> 00:10:06.300
Chill!

00:10:25.910 --> 00:10:26.490
Registry.

00:10:26.940 --> 00:10:28.360
The sensors never picked up a thing.

00:10:29.500 --> 00:10:29.820
Grace!

00:10:30.540 --> 00:10:30.920
Johnny!

00:10:31.910 --> 00:10:32.990
Help me!

00:10:33.770 --> 00:10:34.370
It's Haji!

00:10:39.970 --> 00:10:40.110
No!

00:10:42.500 --> 00:10:42.700
We'll be right back.

00:10:52.170 --> 00:10:53.170
Are you alright?!

00:11:10.300 --> 00:11:12.440
Tony! Tony!

00:11:37.900 --> 00:11:39.900
weapons with some kind of energy field.

00:11:40.260 --> 00:11:40.720
Dad!

00:11:41.100 --> 00:11:42.680
Pull us out of Quest World now!

00:11:43.760 --> 00:11:44.720
Bring down Quest World!

00:11:49.040 --> 00:11:49.560
Johnny!

00:11:50.100 --> 00:11:51.120
Run for it, kiddo!

00:12:06.880 --> 00:12:08.260
I doubt it.

00:12:34.060 --> 00:12:34.880
SELF JOHNNY!

00:13:38.920 --> 00:13:42.280
We lost, Chief! I will not lose my son!

00:13:48.250 --> 00:13:48.850
Are you alright?

00:13:50.990 --> 00:13:51.930
Grayson Haji!

00:13:52.440 --> 00:13:53.260
I know, son.

00:13:53.840 --> 00:13:55.390
We've got to get back in there!

00:13:55.870 --> 00:13:59.530
I'm afraid I had to destroy our entrance into Quest World to save you.

00:14:00.120 --> 00:14:02.200
Now we'll never be able to fight that thing.

00:14:02.760 --> 00:14:04.580
There is another way.

00:14:08.240 --> 00:14:11.000
There are two monsters living here.

00:14:11.470 --> 00:14:14.840
Destroy one, and you destroy the other.

00:14:15.060 --> 00:14:17.250
I don't understand.

00:14:17.880 --> 00:14:18.680
Who are you?

00:14:19.100 --> 00:14:24.800
I am Jacobi Sporachi, the last of the Sporachi family.

00:14:25.420 --> 00:14:26.320
That's impossible.

00:14:27.240 --> 00:14:29.920
Kobe Sporachi disappeared over 200 years ago.

00:14:30.800 --> 00:14:33.380
True, his body was never found, but...

00:14:33.430 --> 00:14:36.030
That body stands before you now.

00:14:36.620 --> 00:14:37.300
But how?

00:14:38.150 --> 00:14:43.560
Two and a half centuries ago, I was the happiest of men.

00:14:44.760 --> 00:14:49.120
My family had made a fortune in harvesting deep water pearls.

00:14:49.640 --> 00:14:54.030
I had inherited the business as the only living heir.

00:14:54.680 --> 00:14:58.840
I was a young man full of the vigor of life.

00:14:59.410 --> 00:14:59.970
I hired...

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:07.170
a partner to help grow the business frederico worked diligently for me then one fateful day

00:15:07.170 --> 00:15:18.120
one of my divers found the largest black pearl i had ever seen little did i know then that it

00:15:18.120 --> 00:15:27.540
had an evil life all its own the pearl embodied the very essence of greed the pearl's evil spirit

00:15:27.540 --> 00:15:29.980
it was able to feed on Frederico's

00:15:30.160 --> 00:15:35.720
True nature, which was an unbridled lust for wealth and power.

00:15:36.460 --> 00:15:40.320
Frederico used the energy of the pearl for his own gain.

00:15:40.660 --> 00:15:47.520
At the cost of his immortal soul, I tried to stop his terrible corruption.

00:15:48.500 --> 00:15:53.010
And in return, he cursed me with a fate worse than death.

00:15:53.530 --> 00:15:56.400
Eternal life without eternal youth.

00:15:57.040 --> 00:15:59.560
Some years later, Frederico disappeared.

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:04.540
I have stayed near the house to warn others of its evil.

00:16:05.240 --> 00:16:08.540
Alas, I have not always been successful.

00:16:09.170 --> 00:16:13.100
Somewhere in this house, the pearl is hidden.

00:16:13.540 --> 00:16:16.860
And if we destroy it, we destroy the entity.

00:16:17.420 --> 00:16:20.760
Then there still may be a chance to save Haji and Reiss.

00:16:21.270 --> 00:16:24.730
You will relinquish your souls to me.

00:16:26.100 --> 00:16:26.360
Never!

00:16:36.880 --> 00:16:44.900
Checked every room upstairs. Nothing.

00:16:45.890 --> 00:16:52.840
Kitchen, too. What's wrong, Mr. Sparazzi?

00:16:53.890 --> 00:16:56.540
Wall. It was never there before.

00:16:58.790 --> 00:16:59.970
There's air coming through here.

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:00.220
We'll be right back.

00:17:04.730 --> 00:17:05.970
There's something behind this!

00:17:08.500 --> 00:17:10.400
We need something to break through this wall.

00:17:10.840 --> 00:17:12.860
And I know just the thing! Come on!

00:17:14.870 --> 00:17:15.770
He's on the season.

00:17:16.090 --> 00:17:16.510
YouTube.

00:17:35.940 --> 00:17:36.760
Where are we?

00:17:37.290 --> 00:17:37.590
Ah!

00:17:38.220 --> 00:17:39.860
It is the old courtyard!

00:17:41.010 --> 00:17:43.110
Frederico must have sealed it all.

00:17:43.340 --> 00:17:44.060
For some reason.

00:17:46.150 --> 00:17:46.710
The brush!

00:17:49.190 --> 00:17:50.010
We must.

00:17:50.780 --> 00:17:51.300
DESTROY IT!

00:17:52.580 --> 00:17:53.020
Well, Dad.

00:17:53.700 --> 00:17:54.440
Can you give me a lift?

00:17:55.240 --> 00:17:59.460
It's been a long time since I carried you on my shoulders but I think I can still manage.

00:18:00.250 --> 00:18:00.990
You

00:18:44.330 --> 00:18:45.880
You patix!

00:18:49.970 --> 00:18:52.040
Depo with meeeeeee!

00:19:01.660 --> 00:19:03.020
Do not do it, my friend!

00:19:03.530 --> 00:19:04.910
Don't do it, kiddo!

00:19:05.200 --> 00:19:06.780
You will finish us all!

00:19:09.130 --> 00:19:15.130
No, it's all lies!

00:19:15.540 --> 00:19:16.440
You're not Haji!

00:19:16.770 --> 00:19:17.710
You're not race!

00:19:18.330 --> 00:19:19.850
I am power!

00:19:20.890 --> 00:19:22.030
I am riches!

00:19:22.550 --> 00:19:25.460
I am everything you yearn for!

00:19:26.390 --> 00:19:28.380
No, you're...

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:00.520
My life!

00:20:01.050 --> 00:20:02.990
Owe it to me later, when we're outta here!

00:20:42.890 --> 00:20:43.490
Thank you.

00:20:51.950 --> 00:20:54.250
Jacobi can finally go to his eternal rest.

00:20:54.760 --> 00:20:55.440
In peace.
